      "finding": "The panel callback result is stored in set_doze_ret and logged on failure, but the function returns a different ret variable. It still updates the cached DISP_FEATURE_DOZE_BRIGHTNESS value after a failed panel callback.",
      "consequence": "A successful sysfs/ioctl-level return and matching brightness readback do not establish successful panel programming.",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/MiCode/MTK_kernel_device_modules/blob/9c6256406e2afb9c316fe3be05a66c1eaa88d900/drivers/gpu/drm/mediatek/mediatek_v2/mi_disp/mi_dsi_panel.c#L1576"
